(st pending)←preparePending(_con sql);stmt
⍝ Prepare SQL and create pending result in one step
⍝ _con: connection pointer
⍝ sql: SQL statement to prepare
⍝ returns: (duckdb_state pending_result_ptr)

stmt←prepareQuery _con sql
:If stmt=0
    st←DuckDBError
    pending←0
    →0
:EndIf

(st pending)←api.duckdb_pending_prepared stmt 0
{}destroyPrepared stmt

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
